Package: norka
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Norka <https://github.com/norka-app/Norka>
Homepage: https://github.com/norka-app/Norka
Depends: libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0
Recommends: libayatana-appindicator3-1
Description: SSH tunnel manager
 Norka keeps SSH local, remote and dynamic tunnels in one window
 and can sit in the system tray. The interface is in Russian.
 The tray icon needs a StatusNotifier host (AppIndicator on GNOME,
 or the tray built into KDE and Xfce).
